ধাপ ৪ — Environment Variables

* .env
* API URL management

ধাপ ৫ — JWT Authentication

* Login
* Logout
* Access Token
* Refresh Token
* Protected Route
* Protected API

আমার current project structure:

React Side:
- src/api/axios.js → axios instance, baseURL: http://localhost:8000/api
- src/pages/Home.jsx → Home page, useNavigate
- src/pages/TodoPage.jsx → Todo CRUD, loading/error state
- src/pages/TodoDetail.jsx → Single todo, useParams
- src/pages/NotFound.jsx → 404 page
- src/components/TodoList.jsx → todos map করে TodoItem render করে
- src/components/TodoForm.jsx → নতুন todo add করে
- src/main.jsx → BrowserRouter দিয়ে App wrap করা
- src/App.jsx → Routes সেটআপ, Link navigation

